  "result": "All 617 tests pass. The fix: `keysetPredicate` in `src/server/repositories/_paging.ts` was only comparing the sort column (`lt(sortColumn, cursorValue)`), so rows sharing the exact same timestamp as the cursor row (bulk imports, batch notifications, batch audit entries) were permanently excluded from subsequent pages since none of them were strictly less than the cursor's timestamp. Added the `idColumn` tiebreaker (`sortColumn < cursor OR (sortColumn == cursor AND idColumn < cursorId)`) to match the existing `ORDER BY sortColumn DESC, idColumn DESC` used across all repositories, making pagination a correct composite keyset cursor.",
